dpll-mgr (1.2.0) stable; urgency=medium

  * Add a status.json writer for external monitoring, with per-pin state
    published per DPLL engine (EEC/PPS), derived from the live DPLL and
    flushed on any input pin change
  * Complete the source-level rename from apts_mgr to dpll-mgr
  * Convert logging to syslog (pr_* macros)
  * Add sd_notify lifecycle, systemd watchdog and configuration
    validation
  * Disconnect PTP pins when ptp4l is dead or wedged, and keep them
    disconnected while it is dead
  * Bound and sequence-match ptp4l management GET replies
  * Source grandmaster presence from TIME_STATUS_NP instead of
    PARENT_DATA_SET
  * Reject an SDP lock and drop to holdover when the backhaul has no
    grandmaster; reconcile REF0N selectability against live GM presence
    on every tick
  * Add ts2_1 gearshift support for the second (E830) fronthaul ts2phc
  * Add GNSS-side (ts2phc) liveness detection
  * Skip no-op DPLL pin state changes

 -- Difu Hu <difu.hu@windriver.com>  Thu, 12 Nov 2026 11:45:00 -0500

dpll-mgr (1.1.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Update to Intel apts_mgr July 3 2026 drop
  * Add timing delay compensation (ZL3073x phase_adjust)
  * Add MGMT_ID_GEAR_STATUS_NP (0xC0F1)
  * Add startup master detection and gear correction
  * Pin count limit raised 24 -> 32

 -- Cole Walker <cole.walker@windriver.com>  Tue, 08 Jul 2026 15:00:00 -0400

